		{"id":"751d12275248ae92","x":3966,"y":494,"width":409,"height":174,"type":"text","text":"In this example each vertical edge of the grid was deformed to look like a lightning bolt. Then, each horizontal edge was redrawn as a bent curve. Note that all the vertical pieces were changed in the same way, and that all horizontal pieces look the same as well."},
