		{"id":"039c8186dd32da08","type":"text","text":"[...] structure of a material and its thermal conductivity coefficient have shown that lower values of this coefficient can be achieved with a more complex structure that mimics natural forms. This paper presents a design method based on the Voronoi diagram [...]","x":-19,"y":242,"width":443,"height":165},
